# Personal deploy guards (Portfolio)

- Production path: GitHub PR → merge to `master` → Vercel Git integration only.
- Vercel MCP/CLI inspect stays **blocked** until `orgId`/`projectId` are verified against team `flackosss` and written into `.deploy/binding.json` + personal manifest.
- Never run `vercel --prod`, `vercel link`, `vercel unlink`, or scope/project switching.
- Before any provider action, run `%LOCALAPPDATA%\cursor-agent\personal\scripts\Assert-PersonalProject.ps1 -ProjectSlug nicolas-ceballos-brito -Operation sensitive`.
- Secrets never go in git, chat, MCP JSON, or scripts.
